<https://w3id.org/dkg/graph/larder>
    a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/dkg/ns> , <https://w3id.org/dkg/ns/adr> ;
    rdfs:label "Larder — ADR & Principles knowledge graph (seed, 2026-09-15)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Seeded from LarderArchitecturalPrinciples.md, ADR0001–ADR0005 and SadrsLarder.md. Uses the project's base IRI and the :D_SADR000n / :Ctx_ / :Act_ / :Con_ slugging of the existing project graph so it merges by concatenation." .

