    dkg:ingestedAt "2026-09-15"^^xsd:date ;
    dkg:defect "Two entries carry the ID AP0005: 'AP0005—Automatic Testing' and 'AP0005 —Micro-UIs'. Kept verbatim in dkg:principleId; disambiguated only in the IRIs :Prin_AP0005a_AutomaticTesting / :Prin_AP0005b_MicroUIs." ;
    dkg:defect "AP0007 Monitoring carries the Implications line 'Using a large monolithic frontend would us slow down.' — identical to AP0005 Micro-UIs and unrelated to monitoring. Copy-paste; emitted verbatim on :Prin_AP0007_Monitoring." .

